{"id": "EUVD-2026-59142", "enisaUuid": "ae093134-490e-372f-b966-00d88c41b6bd", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nselinux: check connect-related permissions on TCP Fast Open\n\nSimilar to Landlock, SELinux was not updated when TCP Fast Open\nsupport was introduced to ensure connect-related permissions are\nchecked when using TCP Fast Open. Update its socket_sendmsg() hook to\ncall selinux_socket_connect() when MSG_FASTOPEN is passed.", "datePublished": "2026-08-15T05:54:31", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T18:45:04", "baseScore": 8.4, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:C/C:H/I:H/A:N", "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/11406d0d7e11b4e525bb2ace2c70107031d058da", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e507633bf76bccf1a6af27771fb0d6e2862b7eac", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d028bc080a0dcd6a7f8e1ae1bd32dda696505ba3", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fc633a598206d4f23af782db7c0b5f3a82751d2c", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/646ebbc5f2ff9147d084e1213143f091026a611c", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/44c74d27d1b9aaa99fa8a83640c1223575262b80"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-72243", "GHSA-m92q-543g-vq9x"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.17, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "06071ed4-6f38-3846-889a-7fbef6f6ae7e", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "3.6"}, {"id": "29dc0cf8-080b-3c5d-a236-4083ebad8727", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.97"}, {"id": "2c0ec612-26e9-3838-afd6-659e2eb8b5c6", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2"}, {"id": "34f1a66f-9dac-37af-97f8-654d2bec7e57", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.1.5"}, {"id": "373110e8-711f-3e20-ba6a-d52dce75489a", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.1.178"}, {"id": "52f3536c-b9cb-3196-9622-881